-- k215_final_thm1 (L10, audit E8): the theorem-1 root. It is the former body of k215_final_full
-- without the G3 parts (no k215_assembly_g3_parts, no L07 modules in the closure). It proves
-- K215_halts_iff_ZFC_inconsistent_final with no hypotheses. k215_final_full imports it.
-- Unstaged final assembly (L10). Same composition as the staged chain
-- (k215_final_staged + k215_assembly_g1_staged + k215_assembly_levels_staged), but every
-- receipt-backed hypothesis is discharged by importing the module that proves it:
--   hm  k215ZFC_refutation_from_Limages            k215_comparison_completed_schemas
--   hn  sfLNonempty_zfr                            source_l_nonempty
--   hN  k215PActualNativeLaw                       k215_literal_runtime_native_assembled_full
--   hE hU hS hL hM  hierarchy facts                source_l_universal_hierarchy_{exists,unique,limit},
--                                                  source_l_compact_hierarchy_{subset,stage}
--   hK  sfLPowerLevelBound_from_hierarchy_zfr      source_l_power_collection_kernel
--   hT  sfLSeparationStageTrans_zfr                source_l_separation_image_transitive_producer
--   hZ  sfCLZero_zfr                               source_l_common_level_zero_lift
--   hLaw uniform definable Replacement law         source_l_replacement_final_law (L02,
--                                                  sfLReplacementDefinableLaws_closed)
--   hlv k215BLvl (k215FinalFull_levels)            source_l_clstage_levels via k215_assembly_blvl
--                                                  applied to sfLReplacementDefinableLaw_zfr at psi = (z = z)
--   hSep Separation images in L                    source_l_separation_image_definable_final
--        (k215FinalFull_separation)               (sfLSeparationImage_schema_from_definable_law) with the
--                                                  law (sfLReplacementDefinableLaw_zfr), uniform by if-bound
-- Remaining open premise (rule hypothesis): hF Fixed images in L; and the BB bridge as antecedent.
-- Needs the capacity2 checker (exclusive host) and the staged large sources.
